      "act": "THE QUIET WEEKS",
      "new_visual_element": "Three calm weeks, then the drop",
      "narration": "The model predicts likely bathroom-need windows for a care programme, from caregiver logs: hydration, meal timing, sleep, activity, time of day. For three weeks it is quiet. Accuracy sits around 0.64 and the input distributions barely move. Then in week seven the routine the programme follows changes, and accuracy falls to 0.56. Nobody filed a bug, because nothing failed.",
