      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "THE MATH",
      "new_visual_element": "Two tests: has the input moved, is the new one better",
      "narration": "Two numbers run the whole platform. The first compares the shape of today's live inputs against the reference shape they had at training, bucket by bucket. If a bucket is much fuller than it used to be, that term grows. The second is an ordinary two-proportion test, asking whether a candidate model is genuinely better than the one in production or just luckier on a small sample.",
      "narration_text": "Two numbers run the whole platform. The first compares the shape of today's live inputs against the reference shape they had at training, bucket by bucket. If a bucket is much fuller than it used to be, that term grows. The second is an ordinary two-proportion test, asking whether a candidate model is genuinely better than the one in production or just luckier on a small sample.",
