      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "THE GATE",
      "new_visual_element": "Promote, roll back, or keep the incumbent",
      "narration": "Detecting drift is not the hard part. Deciding what to do is. A retrained candidate does not simply replace the model in production. It gets a slice of real traffic and has to earn the swap. Above a z of plus two it is promoted. Below minus two it is rolled back. A tie keeps the incumbent, because the model already carrying the load wins a draw.",
      "narration_text": "Detecting drift is not the hard part. Deciding what to do is. A retrained candidate does not simply replace the model in production. It gets a slice of real traffic and has to earn the swap. Above a z of plus two it is promoted. Below minus two it is rolled back. A tie keeps the incumbent, because the model already carrying the load wins a draw.",
